  "title": "Hidden tag names disclosed through bulk topic actions",
  "summary": "### Impact\r\n\r\nUsers who can edit a topic could learn the names of tags on that topic that are hidden from them, such as staff-only tags.\r\n\r\nThis affects sites with tagging enabled that use tag groups to hide tags from some users and limit which tags can be used in each category. Only tag names are disclosed. Topic content and permissions are not affected.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nFixed in 2026.11.0-latest.1, 2026.10.1, 2026.9.2, 2026.7.5.\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-6WJ8381O.",
